%N A218957 Total number of maximal abelian subgroups of the symmetric group, counting conjugates as distinct.
%C A218957 A maximal Abelian subgroup of S_n is a direct product of regular Abelian permutation groups on its nontrivial orbits, together with at most one fixed point. - _Vladeta Jovovic_, Sep 24 2026
